---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Copyright Policy - JKSPDC Portal" 
  description="Copyright Policy regarding re-use of public domain content, tender documents, and official publications of JKSPDC."
>
  <div class="space-y-8">
    <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
    <nav class="text-xs text-slate-500" aria-label="Breadcrumbs">
      <ol class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:underline">Home</a></li>
        <li>/</li>
        <li><span class="text-slate-400">Policies</span></li>
        <li>/</li>
        <li><span class="font-semibold text-[#0B4F9C]">Copyright Policy</span></li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-5">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#0B4F9C]">Copyright Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-650 mt-1">Information on copyright ownership, re-use permissions, and content usage rights for the JKSPDC portal.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Main Content Area -->
      <main class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
        <section class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">Copyright Ownership</h2>
          <p>
            Material featured on this website may be reproduced free of charge in any format or media without requiring specific permission, provided the material is reproduced accurately, is not used in a derogatory manner or in a misleading context, and is acknowledged as belonging to <strong>Jammu &amp; Kashmir State Power Development Corporation Limited (JKSPDCL)</strong>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">Attribution &amp; Source Mention</h2>
          <p>
            Where the material is published or issued to others, the source must be prominently acknowledged as <em>JKSPDCL Official Web Portal (www.jkspdc.in)</em>. However, the permission to reproduce this material does not extend to any material on this site which is identified as being the copyright of a third party. Authorization to reproduce such material must be obtained from the copyright holders concerned.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">Official Logos &amp; Crests</h2>
          <p>
            Use of the official JKSPDCL Emblem, J&amp;K Government Crest, or corporate logos for commercial, advertising, or non-official purposes without explicit written authorization is strictly prohibited under law.
          </p>
        </section>
      </main>

      <!-- Sidebar -->
      <aside class="space-y-4">
        <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 p-5 rounded-xl shadow-sm space-y-2">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">Policy Navigation</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-semibold text-[#0B4F9C]">
            <li><a href="/policies/accessibility" class="hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">&rarr; Accessibility Statement</a></li>
            <li><a href="/policies/privacy" class="hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">&rarr; Privacy Policy</a></li>
            <li><a href="/policies/terms" class="hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">&rarr; Terms of Use</a></li>
            <li><a href="/policies/hyperlinking" class="hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">&rarr; Hyperlinking Policy</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
